lavender-0996: Adreno 512 (a5xx) in TopazAdreno.cpp, from the shim GPU probes

GPU power (GCC, CX GDSC, GFX LDO BHS, GX), GPU SMMU stream on the last
mapping group (TRANS 0x300; the hypervisor rejects group 0), zap from
/usr/share/firmware/lavender (TZ PIL 13), a5xx init, PM4+PFP microcode,
ME_INIT and SET_SECURE_MODE 0. RedwoodGPU reports chip 5.1.2.0, GMEM 272 KB.
GPU pool 0xa4000000 (384 MB). Boot-arg gpu=1 (gpu_mhz=19/300/600).

